        "text": "overstepped the authority of federal immigration law.",
        "isCorrect": true,
        "analysis": "定位至第三段 S6-S7：“Justice Anthony Kennedy ... ruled that the state flew too close to the federal sun. On the overturned provisions the majority held that Congress had deliberately 'occupied the field' and Arizona had thus intruded on the federal's privileged powers.” 多数派法官判定国会已对移民全域立法先占（occupied the field），亚利桑那州立法的做法侵犯了联邦专有特权（intruded on privileged powers），逾越了联邦移民法的至高法定权威（overstepped the authority of federal immigration law）。",
