    "questionNumber": 37,
    "stem": "On which of the following did the Justices agree, according to Paragraph 4?",
    "stemTranslation": null,
    "options": [
      {
        "key": "A",
        "text": "States' independence from federal immigration law.",
        "isCorrect": false,
        "distractorType": "CONTRADICTION",
        "analysis": "正反混淆。原文强调的是联邦与州的‘joint’（联合）与‘cooperate’（协作），州在执法中必须与联邦协同，绝非‘脱离联邦移民法而独立（independence）’。",
        "vocab": [
          {
            "word": "Federal",
            "ipa": "[ˈfedərəl]",
            "meaning": "联邦的",
            "level": "green",
            "isSelfAnnotated": false
          },
          {
            "word": "withhold",
            "ipa": "[wɪðˈhəʊld]",
            "meaning": "隐瞒",
            "level": "red",
            "isSelfAnnotated": true
          }
        ],
        "selfAnnotated": true
      },
      {
        "key": "B",
        "text": "Federal officers' duty to withhold immigrants' information.",
        "isCorrect": false,
        "distractorType": "CONTRADICTION",
        "analysis": "正反颠倒。第四段末句明确提到国会鼓励州官员与联邦同行‘share information’（共享信息），选项却反向捏造为‘withhold information’（隐瞒/拒绝提供信息）。",
        "vocab": [
          {
            "word": "independence",
            "ipa": "[ˌɪndɪˈpendəns]",
            "meaning": "独立",
            "level": "green",
            "isSelfAnnotated": false
          },
          {
            "word": "federal",
            "ipa": "[ˈfedərəl]",
            "meaning": "联邦的",
            "level": "green",
            "isSelfAnnotated": false
          }
        ],
        "selfAnnotated": false
      },
      {
        "key": "C",
        "text": "States' legitimate role in immigration enforcement.",
        "isCorrect": true,
        "analysis": "定位至第四段：“However, the Justices said that Arizona police would be allowed to verify the legal status of people ... That's because Congress has always envisioned joint federal-state immigration enforcement ...” 大法官们一致判定允许亚利桑那警方核查可疑人员移民身份，并指出国会一直设想并鼓励联邦与各州的‘联合执法（joint enforcement）’，这说明大法官们均认可各州在移民执法中拥有不可剥夺的合法角色与正当地位（States' legitimate role in immigration enforcement）。",
        "vocab": [
          {
            "word": "legitimate",
            "ipa": "[lɪˈdʒɪtɪmət]",
            "meaning": "合法的",
            "level": "green",
            "isSelfAnnotated": false
          }
        ],
        "selfAnnotated": false
      },
      {
        "key": "D",
        "text": "Congress's intervention in immigration enforcement.",
        "isCorrect": false,
        "distractorType": "CONCEPT_DISTORTION",
        "analysis": "曲解文意。第四段提到国会历来设想联合执法并‘鼓励（encourages）’合作，并未表达大法官们赞同国会对执法的‘不当行政干预（intervention）’。",
        "vocab": [
          {
            "word": "intervention",
            "ipa": "[ˌɪntəˈvenʃ(ə)n]",
            "meaning": "干预",
            "level": "red",
            "isSelfAnnotated": true
          }
        ],
        "selfAnnotated": true
      }
    ],
    "officialAnswer": "C",
    "standardType": "DETAIL",
    "type": null,
    "targetSentences": null,
    "verbatimEvidence": null,
