    },
    "methodologyReview": "事实细节题。第四段首句转折词 However 引出法官们的一致裁定：allowed to verify legal status。原因在于 joint federal-state enforcement。allowed to verify + joint enforcement 精准对应了 States' legitimate role（州在执法中的合法地位）。",
